# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SmartTavern .gitignore  (M0-T0)
#
# Conventions: one section per tool, comments say WHY an entry exists when the
# reason is not obvious. Never commit generated artifacts or secrets: hard
# invariant #6 of docs/02-技术架构.md says keys must never reach logs/packages.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Dependencies / package managers ---------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.npm-cache/
.local-appdata/
.pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
.yarn/
.pnp.*
.yarnrc.yml

# --- TypeScript / JS build output ------------------------------------------
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/
.rollup.cache/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
.eslintcache

# --- Test output / coverage ------------------------------------------------
coverage/
.nyc_output/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.vitest/

# --- Rust / Tauri (apps/desktop) -------------------------------------------
target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# --- SmartTavern package artifacts -----------------------------------------
# .stpack fixtures are generated by tests/tools (pack → unpack round-trips);
# never commit them — the test must build its own fixtures.
*.stpack
!**/fixtures/**/*.stpack
stpack-out/
*.stpack.tmp

# Generated JSON Schema export is a build artifact of tools/schema-export.
# docs/06-开发任务拆解.md M0-T2 requires schema/package-1.json to be generated
# from the single Zod definition and COMMITTED so third parties can validate
# against it, so that path is deliberately NOT ignored once M0-T2 lands.

# --- Secrets / local environment ------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
*.pem
secrets.json

# Host-specific development notes: our machine's restrictions and the workarounds
# they need. Deliberately untracked — CONTRIBUTING.md keeps only what is true on
# any machine, and this file is where the local exceptions live.
LOCAL-DEV-NOTES.md

# Host-specific development tooling and caches. The reasons are themselves host
# specific, so they live in the untracked LOCAL-DEV-NOTES.md rather than here.
.local-dev/

# --- Stray logs -------------------------------------------------------------
# Some toolchain crash handlers write `debug.log` into the working directory when
# their crash database is unavailable. Never commit those.
*.log

# --- Test litter -------------------------------------------------------------
# `tools/stpack-cli` tests unpack into a temp directory inside the workspace, so a
# failed run cannot strand files in the OS temp dir; it must never leave them staged.
.tmp-*/
*.tmp
